WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.100 --> 00:00:04.750
Protons decide the element; protons plus neutrons give the mass.

2
00:00:05.475 --> 00:00:10.800
Carbon has six protons and six neutrons in its nucleus, and six electrons.

3
00:00:12.913 --> 00:00:17.938
Add one proton and it becomes nitrogen: the protons decide the element.

4
00:00:21.498 --> 00:00:26.023
Add a neutron instead: still carbon, but heavier. Carbon thirteen.

5
00:00:26.574 --> 00:00:29.799
Nearly all the mass is in the tiny nucleus.
